[00:07.53]Wanted you to see the best part of me
{"多想让你看见最好的我"}
[00:11.36]Never knew that I could fall so quickly
{"从未想过会如此快速沦陷"}
[00:15.39]Now it's over and I can't stop thinking
{"如今结束却无法停止思念"}
[00:18.89]Will we ever be the same?
{"我们能否回到从前"}
[00:22.59]I got over all the shit that you said
{"我已释怀你那些伤人话语"}
[00:26.36]I admit that it all went to my head
{"承认它们曾让我迷失自己"}
[00:30.34]Got a little crazy, there at the end
{"最后时刻确实有些失控"}
[00:33.97]At the end
{"最后时刻"}
[00:36.60]I'm still holding on to all the stupid flowers
{"仍紧握着那些可笑的花束"}
[00:40.29]They were your mistakes but you said they were ours
{"明明是你的错却说是共渡"}
[00:44.07]Now they're dried up, dead, and sitting in my closet
{"如今它们枯死在我的衣柜"}
[00:47.86]And I'm tryna find the strength to go and lock it
{"正努力攒足勇气锁上柜门"}
[00:51.61]And throw away the key
{"然后把钥匙丢弃"}
